    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "One result is an anecdote. The block train-and-score (a model, its optimizer, a short training run and the test accuracy) is placed five times. The engine derives a separate seed for every node from the run seed and the node's id, and the five copies have different ids, so each starts from different weights and sees the batches in a different order. Same recipe, five results: mean accuracy 0.859, standard deviation 0.010, from 0.842 to 0.869. Report the mean with its spread, and treat a difference smaller than the spread as no difference.\n\n只有一個結果只是個案。區塊 train-and-score（模型、它的 optimizer、一段短訓練與測試正確率）放了五次。引擎依照 run seed 與節點 id 替每個節點導出各自的 seed，五份的 id 不同，所以各自從不同的權重開始、以不同的順序看到 batch。同一個做法、五個結果：平均正確率 0.859，標準差 0.010，從 0.842 到 0.869。回報平均值與它的離散程度；比離散程度還小的差異，就當作沒有差異。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-study",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": -217
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Double-click a block to open and edit it; all five copies change together. More seeds means more copies here, or a study: the Studies button on the Runs tab of the bottom panel lists the studies submitted through POST /api/studies or the Graph Copilot plugin, with each variant's mean, standard deviation and count over its repetitions.\n\n雙擊區塊可以打開編輯，五份會一起改變。要更多 seed，就在這裡多放幾份，或改用 study：下方面板「執行任務」分頁上的Studies 按鈕，會列出透過 POST /api/studies 或 Graph Copilot 外掛送出的 study，以及每個做法在重複執行下的平均、標準差與次數。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "summary",
        "boundOffset": {
